---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const faqSchema = {
 "@context": "https://schema.org",
 "@type": "FAQPage",
 "mainEntity": [
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is the email deliverability section?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "It's a curated collection of guides and tools focused on email deliverability, organized from fundamentals to advanced configurations."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Are all these pages free?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Yes: every guide and tool on PromptDNS is free forever, with no account and no limits."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "How do I navigate this section?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Start with the first card and follow the internal links. Each page connects to related topics so you naturally build understanding."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "How often is this content updated?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Money pages are reviewed and refreshed every 90 days. New guides are added weekly as the topical map expands."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Can I suggest a topic that's missing?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Yes: email hello@promptdns.com with your suggestion. We prioritize based on search demand and user feedback."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Is this content written by experts?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Every page follows a documented editorial standard: verified processes, tool-verified instructions, and regular reviews. See the About page for details."
   }
  }
 ]
}
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Email Deliverability: The Complete Guide"
  description="Email deliverability explained: authentication, sender reputation, blocklists, warm-up, and the infrastructure decisions that keep mail in the inbox."
  schema={[faqSchema]}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-4 text-sm text-ink-faint" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-accent">Home</a>
       <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/email-deliverability/" class="hover:text-accent">Email Deliverability</a>
       <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="text-ink-dim">Email Deliverability</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">Email Deliverability</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
      Deliverability is the discipline of getting mail delivered to the inbox instead of the spam
      folder or a bounce. It rests on four pillars: authentication (proving you are you),
      reputation (earned by behavior), infrastructure (IPs, PTR, TLS), and recipient engagement.
      This hub connects every piece.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
      {[
        { href: '/why-emails-go-to-spam/', title: 'Why emails go to spam', desc: 'The 14 causes, strongest first, with the fix for each.' },
        { href: '/email-bounced-reasons/', title: 'Why emails bounce', desc: 'Hard vs soft bounces, SMTP codes, and the handling routine.' },
        { href: '/email-sending-reputation/', title: 'Sender reputation', desc: 'How IP and domain reputation are built, damaged, and repaired.' },
        { href: '/how-to-warm-up-email-server/', title: 'Warm-up schedule', desc: 'Ramp a new server or domain over 4-6 weeks safely.' },
        { href: '/dedicated-vs-shared-ip/', title: 'Dedicated vs shared IP', desc: 'Which sending infrastructure your volume actually needs.' },
        { href: '/list-unsubscribe-header/', title: 'List-Unsubscribe headers', desc: 'The one-click unsubscribe requirement, implemented.' },
        { href: '/imap-vs-smtp/', title: 'IMAP vs SMTP vs POP3', desc: 'Which protocol does what, and ports that matter.' },
        { href: '/cold-email-deliverability/', title: 'Cold Email Deliverability', desc: 'Authentication, warm-up, volume control, and list quality for outbound campaigns.' },
      ].map((s) => (
        <a href={s.href} class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40">
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-accent">{s.title}</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-dim">{s.desc}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-accent/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/10 to-violet/10 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Start with the diagnosis</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-dim">
        Run the <a href="/" class="font-medium text-accent hover:text-accent-soft">homepage security scanner</a> (SPF, DKIM,
        DMARC, DNSSEC in one pass), then the <a href="/blacklist-checker/" class="font-medium text-accent hover:text-accent-soft">blacklist checker</a>.
        Authentication and listings account for most deliverability failures.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3"><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What is the email deliverability section?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">It's a curated collection of guides and tools focused on email deliverability, organized from fundamentals to advanced configurations.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Are all these pages free?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Yes: every guide and tool on PromptDNS is free forever, with no account and no limits.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How do I navigate this section?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Start with the first card and follow the internal links. Each page connects to related topics so you naturally build understanding.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How often is this content updated?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Money pages are reviewed and refreshed every 90 days. New guides are added weekly as the topical map expands.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can I suggest a topic that's missing?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Yes: email hello@promptdns.com with your suggestion. We prioritize based on search demand and user feedback.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Is this content written by experts?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Every page follows a documented editorial standard: verified processes, tool-verified instructions, and regular reviews. See the About page for details.</p></details></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
